        "created_at": "2014-09-01T06:14:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I usually start with&nbsp;defensive powers, then switch to an offensive power when it comes to my turn and I'm able to reach someone. Especially against Tachyon, she can reach you in no time.</p>",
