        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-01T20:25:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Playtesters - when you were doing skirmishes, was there ever an issue of who chose powers first? &nbsp;I can imagine a scenario where it matters, because my optimal choice of power might depend on which power you choose, and vice versa.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
