        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-02T02:17:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've let people change powers after they realized powers someone else had available, we just let everyone after them change powers to react if they want.</p><p>We don't get competetive about he start, but I have a few players that get a bit feisty at times, so I always make sure I run things tournament style, just to make sure.</p>",
