        "created_at": "2014-11-07T00:04:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Excellent, this also answers my question.</p><p>For some reason, the rulebook doesn't seem to have a setup section (that I could find), so the first time we played this game, we assumed, just the card game, that we would have to build up our powers and movement slowly over time.</p><p>Would it be possible to put this in the FAQ?</p>",
